  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey! How's everything going?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.78,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can't complain.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My phone has gotten painfully slow and I'm not sure how to fix it.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "block": "smartphones.opt5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Let me describe all the options before you comment.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instr_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, I'll hold on.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I could do a full factory reset and set everything up again from scratch.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.41,
   "block": "smartphones.opt5",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or pay a shop to swap the battery, since I've heard old batteries slow phones down.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 3.69,
   "block": "smartphones.opt5",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Another idea is just deleting a ton of apps and photos to free up space.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 3.82,
   "block": "smartphones.opt5",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or give up and buy a new one, which I really don't want to do.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 5.74,
   "block": "smartphones.opt5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's the full list. Go ahead.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Start with clearing space, it's free and often helps right away. If it's still sluggish, a battery swap is cheap compared to a new phone, and a factory reset is the deep clean if nothing else works.",
   "est_sec": 11.57,
   "gap_before": 0.96,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "smartphones.opt5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, and another thing. I get really anxious on Sunday afternoons. Like a heavy feeling.",
